--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licensed material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  asl_lex_params.json - phonological descriptors and mean sign-frequency
  ratings for 1,279 catalog entries, derived from ASL-LEX 2.0.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution (required)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  ASL-LEX 2.0, by Zed Sevcikova Sehyr, Naomi Caselli, Ariel M. Cohen-Goldberg
  and Karen Emmorey, licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0. Source: https://asl-lex.org/

  Sehyr, Z. S., Caselli, N., Cohen-Goldberg, A. M., & Emmorey, K. (2021).
  The ASL-LEX 2.0 Project: A Database of Lexical and Phonological Properties
  for 2,723 Signs in American Sign Language. Journal of Deaf Studies and Deaf
  Education, 26(2), 263-277. https://doi.org/10.1093/deafed/enaa038

  Modifications: entries selected by curated mapping and frequency threshold;
  phonological descriptors, morpheme sequences, lexical class, citation
  duration and mean sign frequency retained. Column names normalized and
  null fields omitted. Reference video and iconicity data are not bundled.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ASL-Phono exception: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  File: asl_phono_priors.json
  Authors: Cleison Correia de Amorim and Cleber Zanchettin (2021)
  Dataset: ASL-Phono, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5484145
  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
  Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.02065

  Modifications: exact ASL-LEX entry-name matching; aggregation of valid
  dominant-hand orientation and movement frame votes; strict >50% consensus
  gating; conversion to unit vectors in signer-relative body coordinates.
  Counts, confidence, sample identifiers and rejected estimates are retained
  for auditing. No source videos, handshape estimates or facial estimates are
  redistributed in this extract. These are vision estimates, not annotations.

  Attribution, a license link and indication of changes are required. This
  file's CC BY license does not remove the ASL-LEX file's NonCommercial term.
  Source generator code was inspected for coordinate conventions, not copied.

